  {
    "id": "basics-24",
    "title": "Subdivisions",
    "html": "<p>Set the number of subdivisions per beat with <code>@</code> followed by a positive number. For example, <code>@2</code> makes each plain note half a beat long; <code>@1/2</code> makes it two beats long.</p>",
