  },
  {
    "id": "basics-25",
    "title": "Time signatures",
    "html": "<p>Use <code>@time(n/d)</code> to set the time signature for notation and barline checks. It starts a new measure cycle but does not change note durations; use subdivision directives to control rhythmic spacing.</p>",
