  {
    "id": "basics-29",
    "title": "Repeats and alternate endings",
    "html": "<p>Everything between <code>|:</code> and <code>:|</code> is repeated twice by default. Alternate endings use <code>@^1</code> and <code>@^2</code>, or the equivalent superscript numerals attached to bar lines in this example.</p>",
